@namespace Editor.Preferences
@attribute [Title( "Scene View" ), Icon( "videocam" ), Order( 3 )]
@attribute [Description( "The viewport camera, how it is moved, and the handles drawn over the scene." )]
@inherits PreferencesPage

<root class="preferences-page">
	<div class="body" @ref="Body">
		<label class="section-header">Camera</label>
		<div @ref="cameraHost"></div>

		<label class="section-header">Movement</label>
		<div @ref="movementHost"></div>

		<label class="section-header">Cursor</label>
		<div @ref="cursorHost"></div>

		<label class="section-header">Editing</label>
		<div @ref="editingHost"></div>

		<label class="section-header">Gizmo Handles</label>
		<div @ref="gizmoHost"></div>
	</div>
</root>

@code
{
	Panel cameraHost;
	Panel movementHost;
	Panel cursorHost;
	Panel editingHost;
	Panel gizmoHost;

	protected override void OnBuild()
	{
		var camera = AddSheet( cameraHost );
		camera.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraFieldOfView );
		camera.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraBackgroundColor );
		camera.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraZNear );
		camera.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraZFar );

		var movement = AddSheet( movementHost );
		movement.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraSpeed );
		movement.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraSensitivity );
		movement.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CameraInvertPan );
		movement.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.InvertOrbitZoom );
		movement.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.OrbitZoomSpeed );

		var cursor = AddSheet( cursorHost );
		cursor.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.HideRotateCursor );
		cursor.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.HidePanCursor );
		cursor.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.HideOrbitCursor );

		var editing = AddSheet( editingHost );
		editing.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.CreateObjectsAtOrigin );
		editing.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.BoundsPlacement );
		editing.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.PasteAtCursor );
		editing.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.PlaceModelsAsProp );

		var gizmo = AddSheet( gizmoHost );
		gizmo.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.GizmoScale );
		gizmo.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.GizmoRenderDistance );
		gizmo.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.GizmoDepthTest );
		gizmo.AddProperty( () => EditorPreferences.WorldSpaceGizmos );
	}
}
